Subject: [PATCH 1/2] feat: adapt to different kernels

---
 plugins/smap/smap.spec                            |  5 +++--
 plugins/smap/src/drivers/Makefile                 |  8 ++++++++
 .../smap/src/drivers/access_tracking_wrapper.c    |  8 ++++++++
 plugins/smap/src/drivers/accessed_bit.c           | 11 ++++++++++-
 plugins/smap/src/drivers/kvm_pgtable.c            |  8 ++++++++
 plugins/smap/src/tiering/Makefile                 | 15 ++++++++++++++-
 plugins/smap/src/tiering/basic.c                  |  8 ++++++++
 plugins/smap/src/tiering/mig_init.c               |  1 -
 plugins/smap/src/tiering/smap_migrate_pages.c     |  6 ++++++
